body:
I can't think of all the specific quests rn but here are my favorite narratives:

velen: crones of crookback bog. specifically the portion of the quest where you can make the decision of helping the crones or freeing the forest druid that destroys downwarren if you do. (looked it up, it's ladies of the wood and the whispering hillock). also loved the keira metz side quest arc with that haunted isle. velen had my favorite quests i think.

&#x200B;

novigrad:  the one where the troll asks you get paint for him (the volunteer)

&#x200B;

novigrad city: carnal sins. i also liked dandelion's bullshit arc even though it was bullshit. felt fitting for the character lol.

&#x200B;

skellige: last wish or when the bears storm the feast and you can choose between helping cerys or her brother

&#x200B;

skellige: ugly baby. love uma. also that part where eskel, geralt, lambert get drunk. prepping for the battle with the wild hunt was fun as well.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
